&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If the service and Gluetun are in the same docker-compose, add network mode: network_mode: &amp;ldquo;service:gluetun&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;If the service is in a different docker-compose from Gluetun, add network_mode: &amp;ldquo;container:gluetun&amp;rdquo;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Open Gluetun&amp;rsquo;s docker-compose file and re-add the service ports you need (e.g. 8080)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Start Gluetun first, then start services that should use Gluetun&amp;rsquo;s VPN connection&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The container&amp;rsquo;s public IP should match the VPN server you selected&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>